From Alpine's community/git-annex (ghc-9.14.patch, by Antoine Martin).
Lets cabal use, on GHC 9.14.1, releases whose bounds predate it:
persistent (template-haskell < 2.24), feed, botan-low and botan-bindings
(base < 4.22). Upstream issues: yesodweb/persistent#1619, and feed's fix
(haskell-party/feed#78) awaits its 1.3.2.2 release.

diff --git a/cabal.project b/cabal.project
index c4651e9..5d2cd8d 100644
--- a/cabal.project
+++ b/cabal.project
@@ -2,3 +2,8 @@ packages:
   .
 jobs: $ncpus
 semaphore: True
+
+allow-newer: persistent:template-haskell
+allow-newer: feed:base
+allow-newer: botan-low:base
+allow-newer: botan-bindings:base
